ventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHII, JUN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKADA, TOSHIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for decomposing a halogenated hydrocarbon gas by treating a gas containing the halogenated hydrocarbon gas, which conprises a step of rendering a carrier which is resistant to the gas containing the halogenated hydrocarbon gas and has electrical conductivity to carry a decomposition catalyst (4) for the halogenated hydrocarbon gas, and a step of passing the halogenated hydrocarbon gas through the carrier (3), while heating the carrier (3) by using an electromagnetic induction heating mechanism (5, 6).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention a trait à un procédé permettant de décomposer un gaz d'hydrocarbure halogéné par traitement du gaz contenant ledit gaz d'hydrocarbure halogéné, lequel procédé consiste à faire en sorte qu'un support, résistant à au gaz contenant ledit gaz d'hydrocarbure halogéné et possédant une conductivité électrique, soit porteur d'un catalyseur (4) à même de décomposer le gaz d'hydrocarbure halogéné, puis à faire traverser le support (3) par le gaz d'hydrocarbure halogéné, lequel support (3) est chauffé par un équipement chauffant à induction électromagnétique (5, 6).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>